{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgSk7eMfqjGxCqjrsZvij","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You're right. The cause sections and the claims table already assumed the answer: `annual_since`, calendar years, and a Feb 28 rule. Here is the problem without those choices.\n\n**Problem:** Two customers got renewal reminders on dates that don't match the renewal date they expect.\n\n**Observed (from the code and `customers.csv`)**\n- **C-311:** The reminder went out October 19, 2026. Their plan changed to annual in March 2026. Their signup was November 2025.\n- **C-327:** The reminder went out May 17, 2024. They say the renewal is June 1, so that is 15 days ahead. The stated lead time is 14.\n- **Code:** `reminders.py` computes the renewal date from `signup` plus 365 days. The reminder is 14 days before that date.\n- **Test:** The one test covers C-340 only, and it passes.\n\n**What the evidence shows**\n- For C-311, the reminder date follows from the `signup` column. It is consistent with the code and not with the customer's expectation.\n- For C-327, the reminder is 14 days before the date the code calculates. The customer's own renewal date is one day later than that calculated date.\n\n**What I don't know**\n- What the business treats as the renewal date: signup, plan start, or something held elsewhere.\n- Whether \"June 1\" is the date customers are actually billed or only the date they expect.\n- How the nightly job uses `reminder_date`, and whether customers whose date has passed get reminders later.\n- Whether other customers got reminders on wrong dates.\n\n**Open question**\n- Which date should a reminder be measured against, and where does that date come from?\n\nI have taken the cause analysis and the three decision items out of this version. I'll keep them if you want them back as a separate step.\n\nVote GO, NO-GO, or HOLD."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1755,"cache_read_input_tokens":40356,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1755},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c361c0c2-d0b1-4f02-a5a5-b9875bdae357","uuid":"37b38936-d556-42fd-9d2f-ca17debfe82e","timestamp":"2026-10-27T12:30:16.358Z","request_id":"req_011CgSk7dz65U6SnhLyGwTrC"}
